'''Fly Bombs''' are enemies added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]]''. They are characterized by their appearance of a small {{E|Bomb}} with wings.

They chase Isaac, attempting to circle around him as they do so. Upon death, they turn into a tiny {{E|Bomb}} that explodes shorty after. Running into a Fly Bomb causes it to explode instantly. The instant explosion deals a {{e|Half Red Heart}} of damage to Isaac and 40 damage to monsters unlike the tiny bomb's explosion which deals a {{e|Red Heart}} to Isaac and 100 damage to monsters.
{{clear}}

