'''Eternal Fly Bombs''' are variants to Fly Bombs that exclusively spawn in a group of 3 and orbit {{E|Boom Fly|text=Boom Flies}} spawned by {{E|The Horny Boys}}. Similar to {{E|Eternal Fly|text=Eternal Flies}}, they are immune to all damage until their respective Boom Fly dies. Then, they turn into tiny Bombs that explode shortly after. While generally immune to damage they can still be ran into and will explode like regular Fly Bombs.
{{clear}}

